IOMMU enabling
  nano /etc/default/grub
      GRUB_CMDLINE_LINUX_DEFAULT="quiet" => "quite intel_iommu=on"   [for pci pass through]
  update-grub
  
  Now check to make sure everything is enabled.
    dmesg | grep -e DMAR -e IOMMU
    dmesg | grep 'remapping'

CREATE ZFS storage under Node(pve) -> Disks -> ZFS and use the HDD for this.
